{"assets":["/statement-assets/dce4a7abdaad6b54dc24b47b8a087145552c0a64c5b107f06350ebdc4b1c92f0.png","/statement-assets/528813b4b2d60e94f7ac4d1b01a651fe7fc5378e687c540c40f5eb355f6584de.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"689","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. Mike and Shortcuts"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"3 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Recently, Mike was very busy with studying for exams and contests. Now he is going to chill a bit by doing some sight seeing in the city."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"City consists of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" intersections numbered from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":". Mike starts walking from his house located at the intersection number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" and goes along some sequence of intersections. Walking from intersection number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":" to intersection "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"j"},{"kind":"text","text":" requires "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"|i - j|"},{"kind":"text","text":" units of energy. The "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"total energy"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" spent by Mike to visit a sequence of intersections "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"p1 = 1, p2, ..., pk"},{"kind":"text","text":" is equal to "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/dce4a7abdaad6b54dc24b47b8a087145552c0a64c5b107f06350ebdc4b1c92f0.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" units of energy."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Of course, walking would be boring if there were no shortcuts. A "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"shortcut"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" is a special path that allows Mike walking from one intersection to another requiring only "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" unit of energy. There are exactly "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" shortcuts in Mike's city, the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ith"},{"kind":"text","text":" of them allows walking from intersection "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":" to intersection "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i ≤ ai ≤ ai + 1"},{"kind":"text","text":") (but not in the opposite direction), thus there is exactly one shortcut starting at each intersection. Formally, if Mike chooses a sequence "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"p1 = 1, p2, ..., pk"},{"kind":"text","text":" then for each "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ i < k"},{"kind":"text","text":" satisfying "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"pi + 1 = api"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"api ≠ pi"},{"kind":"text","text":" Mike will spend "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"only "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" unit of energy"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" instead of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"|pi - pi + 1|"},{"kind":"text","text":" walking from the intersection "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"pi"},{"kind":"text","text":" to intersection "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"pi + 1"},{"kind":"text","text":". For example, if Mike chooses a sequence "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"p1 = 1, p2 = ap1, p3 = ap2, ..., pk = apk - 1"},{"kind":"text","text":", he spends exactly "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k - 1"},{"kind":"text","text":" units of total energy walking around them."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Before going on his adventure, Mike asks you to find the minimum amount of energy required to reach each of the intersections from his home. Formally, for each "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ i ≤ n"},{"kind":"text","text":" Mike is interested in finding minimum possible total energy of some sequence "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"p1 = 1, p2, ..., pk = i"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains an integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(1 ≤ n ≤ 200 000)"},{"kind":"text","text":" — the number of Mike's city intersection."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a1, a2, ..., an"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(i ≤ ai ≤ n"},{"kind":"text","text":" , "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/528813b4b2d60e94f7ac4d1b01a651fe7fc5378e687c540c40f5eb355f6584de.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":", describing shortcuts of Mike's city, allowing to walk from intersection "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":" to intersection "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai"},{"kind":"text","text":" using only "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" unit of energy. Please note that the shortcuts don't allow walking in opposite directions (from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":")."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the only line print "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m1, m2, ..., mn"},{"kind":"text","text":", where "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"mi"},{"kind":"text","text":" denotes the least amount of total energy required to walk from intersection "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" to intersection "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3\n2 2 3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"0 1 2 \n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"5\n1 2 3 4 5\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"0 1 2 3 4 \n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"7\n4 4 4 4 7 7 7\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"0 1 2 1 2 3 3 \n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first sample case desired sequences are:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1: 1"},{"kind":"text","text":"; "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m1 = 0"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2: 1, 2"},{"kind":"text","text":"; "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m2 = 1"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3: 1, 3"},{"kind":"text","text":"; "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m3 = |3 - 1| = 2"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second sample case the sequence for any intersection "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 < i"},{"kind":"text","text":" is always "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1, i"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"mi = |1 - i|"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the third sample case — consider the following intersection sequences:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1: 1"},{"kind":"text","text":"; "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m1 = 0"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2: 1, 2"},{"kind":"text","text":"; "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m2 = |2 - 1| = 1"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3: 1, 4, 3"},{"kind":"text","text":"; "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m3 = 1 + |4 - 3| = 2"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"math_inline","text":"4: 1, 4"},{"kind":"text","text":"; "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m4 = 1"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"math_inline","text":"5: 1, 4, 5"},{"kind":"text","text":"; "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m5 = 1 + |4 - 5| = 2"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"math_inline","text":"6: 1, 4, 6"},{"kind":"text","text":"; "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m6 = 1 + |4 - 6| = 3"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"math_inline","text":"7: 1, 4, 5, 7"},{"kind":"text","text":"; "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m7 = 1 + |4 - 5| + 1 = 3"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"B","problemCode":"689B","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/689/problem/B"}